      "title": {
        "en": "Rodzice i dziadkowie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Mama* and *tata* are what you call them; *matka* and *ojciec* are the words for mother and father. Together they are *rodzice*. Their parents are *dziadkowie*, *babcia* and *dziadek*, and you are their *wnuk* or *wnuczka*: all the grandchildren are *wnuki*. A husband and a wife are a *małżeństwo*."
      }
    }
